\par\par \b \uc2  Malaysia Bk Negara/Ringgit -3: Stayed Out Of Mkt In Jan. \b0\par\par\uc2 248 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 April 1997\par 14:23\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  During early January when the ringgit strengthened strongly against the dollar, dealers note that Bank Negara was conspicuous by its absence in the market - with no reports of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to depress the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Some had expected the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to step in given the speed of the ringgit's advance. \par \par \uc2  The dollar fell as far as 2.4680 ringgit on January 13 after overseas funds piled into the Malaysian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  early this year on the back of bullish expectations for the economy. \par \par \uc2  Analysts note there were various statements from government officials at that time, and since, indicating they welcomed a stronger local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  against the dollar. \par \par \uc2  Nevertheless, many dealers and economists were surprised by the bank's apparent move to stand in the way of the ringgit's recent slide - and one said it couldn't possibly have happened. \par \par \uc2  Many economists took Bank Negara's recent annual report, issued March 28, as a signal that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would be even less likely to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market. \par \par \uc2  '\b \highlight22\uc2 Malaysia\b0 \highlight\uc2  does not set targets for its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 ,' Bank Negara noted in its report. \par \par \uc2  But, given the speed of the dollar's recent ascent against the ringgit, one dealer said that may have overcome any \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  scruples about \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . 'Would you want your ringgit to weaken so quickly - in a matter of three days?,' asked one dealer. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 09-04-97 \par \par \uc2  1223GMT \par \par \uc2  1145 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt4902ik8\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
