\par\par \b \uc2  Malaysia Ringgit -2: Ringgit's Rise Tempered: Dealer \b0\par\par\uc2 267 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 Mai 1996\par 10:57\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  A ringgit dealer in Hong Kong said that early Monday investors bought Singapore dollars for ringgit after Singapore reported first-quarter growth ahead of market expectations, at 10.7%, up from a revised figure of 8.8% growth in the fourth quarter of 1995. \par \par \uc2  He said that helped to weaken the Malaysian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  against the U.S. dollar. \par \par \uc2  At the same time, he added, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Bank Negara \b \highlight22\uc2 Malaysia\b0 \highlight\uc2 , secretly \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market late last week to signal it wanted the dollar to trade around 2.4825 ringgit. The \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  couldn't be confirmed. \par \par \uc2  'The speed of the Malaysian ringgit's rise will be tempered for a while,' the dealer said. \par \par \uc2  He expects the dollar to trade between 2.4800 ringgit and 2.5000 ringgit this week. \par \par \uc2  Bank Negara Malaysia borrowed 1-month funds at 6.95% Monday. Noting that the rate was the same level at which the \b \highlight22\uc2 central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been borrowing for some time, dealers said it didn't signal anything but the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's desire to mop up some of the liquidity in the market. \par \par \uc2  In the money market, at the late morning fixing, the one-month Kuala Lumpur Interbank Offered Rates (KLIBOR) were unchanged at 7.06%. The three-month KLIBOR were at 7.14%, down from 7.15% Friday. The six-month KLIBOR were at 7.19%, down from 7.20% Friday. \par \par \uc2  The overnight rate, which indicates short-term liquidity conditions, closed at 5.70%, down from 5.75% Friday. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 13-05-96 \par \par \uc2  0857GMT \par \par \uc2  1026 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011013ds5d0402a\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
