\par\par \b \uc2  Malaysian Ringgit Up Vs U.S. Dlr On Negara  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 269 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 25 Januar 1996\par 10:00\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  KUALA LUMPUR (AP-DJ)--The U.S. dollar weakened against the Malaysian ringgit Thursday as players became cautious when the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Bank Negara \b \highlight22\uc2 Malaysia\b0 \highlight\uc2 , \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market and sold dollars, traders said. \par \par \uc2  'Bank Negara's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the morning prompted profit taking,' said a chief dealer with a local bank. \par \par \uc2  Traders said that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold less than U.S.$100 million when the dollar was at 2.5640 ringgit. \par \par \uc2  'Though the amount was small, it made players cautious as they expect the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 ,' said a dealer. \par \par \uc2  Around 0856 GMT, the dollar traded at 2.5610 ringgit, lower than 2.5634 ringgit late Wednesday and 2.5630 at the opening. During the day, it traded between 2.5602 and 2.5640 ringgit. \par \par \uc2  Market observers said that players prefer to stay in the sidelines ahead of the release of October trade figures Friday. \par \par \uc2  'Players want to look at the figures before taking any positions,' said a dealer. \par \par \uc2  'The market expects a deficit of around 1.0 billion ringgit, anything above that would lead to selling of the ringgit,' he said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  didn't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the money market Thursday. \par \par \uc2  At the late morning fixing, the one-month Kuala Lumpur Interbank Offered Rates (KLIBOR) was unchanged at 7.00%, and the three-month KLIBOR was at 7.06%, compared with 7.09% Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  The overnight rate closed lower at 6.00% compared to Wednesday's 6.10%. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 25-01-96 \par \par \uc2  0900GMT \par \par \uc2  (Corrected 04:15 ET) \par \par \uc2  1026 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011013ds1p00pr0\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
