\par\par \b \uc2  Malaysian Ringgit Down Vs Dollar; KLIBOR Flat \b0\par\par\uc2 268 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 November 1995\par 11:24\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  KUALA LUMPUR (AP-DJ)--The U.S. dollar strengthened against the Malaysian ringgit in late trading Monday, but the rise was well within the current trading range, traders said. \par \par \uc2  A trader with a local bank said that no clear direction existed for the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but that trading followed the major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  throughout the day. \par \par \uc2  ''There is no clear direction for the ringgit, and players prefer to stay sidelined until fresh news arise,'' he said. \par \par \uc2  Although the London market open saw a slight pickup in activity, traders said that dollar-ringgit trading was narrow for much of the day as the U.S. unit stayed trapped in familiar ranges against its major counterparts. \par \par \uc2  At 1020 GMT, the dollar was trading at 2.5360 ringgit, higher than 2.5330 ringgit around the same time Friday. Its intraday range was 2.5335 to 2.5365 ringgit. \par \par \uc2  In the money market, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Bank Negara \b \highlight22\uc2 Malaysia\b0 \highlight\uc2 , \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the money market by accepting one-month ringgit offers at 6.50%, keeping rates flat. \par \par \uc2  But overnight rates were soft, according to a money market dealer, closing at 6.00% compared with 7.00% Friday. The maturity of one- and three-month \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  funds was cited as the reason for keeping money market liquidity high, money market traders said. \par \par \uc2  At the late morning fixing, the Kuala Lumpur Interbank Offered Rates (KLIBOR) were flat, with the one-month KLIBOR at 6.60%, unchanged from Friday's, and the three-month was also unchanged at 6.80%.< \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 13-11-95 \par \par \uc2  1024GMT \par \par \uc2  1026 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025drbd08xdd\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
