\par\par \b \uc2  Malaysian Ringgit Recover Vs Dlr; But Still Bullish On Dlr \b0\par\par\uc2 259 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 September 1995\par 11:06\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  KUALA LUMPUR (AP-DJ)--The U.S. dollar weakened slightly against the ringgit in late trading Wednesday, after reaching an intraday high of 2.5345 ringgit, traders said. \par \par \uc2  At 0905 GMT, the dollar was quoted at 2.5300 ringgit, compared with the day's range of 2.5345 and 2.5294 ringgit, and 2.5305 ringgit around the same time Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  Traders said that although the dollar broke above the 2.5300 ringgit level, Bank Negara \b \highlight22\uc2 Malaysia\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , didn't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 . It however checked rates from 2.5300-2.5330 ringgit. \par \par \uc2  Sentiment remains bullish on the dollar, although there were some dollar sales following the announcement of Japan's economic stimulus package earlier Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  A trader said that ''there was some dollar selling (against the major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) but the impact is minimal.'' \par \par \uc2  Another trader said that ''a lot of U.S. banks sold at the 2.5320 ringgit level, and there was also a lot of buying interest at the 2.5295 ringgit level.'' \par \par \uc2  Immediate resistance for the dollar is at 2.5330 ringgit, traders said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  didn't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the money market either, but Kuala Lumpur Interbank Offered Rates (KLIBOR) were flat. The one-month KLIBOR was quoted at 6.10%, unchanged from Tuesday, and the three-month KLIBOR at 6.20%, up from Tuesday's 6.15%. The overnight rate was quoted around 6.40%-6.60%, a money market trader said.< \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 20-09-95 \par \par \uc2  0906GMT \par \par \uc2  1026 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025dr9k0788f\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
