\par\par \b \uc2  Malaysian Ringgit Up Vs Dlr; Hits 9-Year High \b0\par\par\uc2 232 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 April 1995\par 11:41\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Co., Inc.) \par \par \uc2  KUALA LUMPUR (AP-DJ)--The Malaysian ringgit rose sharply against the U.S. dollar Thursday in another day of volatile dealings, traders said. \par \par \uc2  They said the ringgit looked unstoppable in its climb upwards as offshore players continued to pile into the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  with the view it could strengthen to 2.4000-ringgit against the dollar in the short term. \par \par \uc2  At the close, the dollar sank to a nine-year low of 2.4655 ringgit, shattering within a day the two support levels of 2.4800 and 2.4700 ringgit. The dollar closed Wednesday at 2.4820 ringgit and opened Thursday at 2.4750 ringgit. \par \par \uc2  It hit an intraday low of 2.4625 ringgit at around 0245 GMT, a trader with a local bank said. 'The ringgit seems to be flavor of the month among foreign players...everybody wants to buy it,' he added. \par \par \uc2  Although Bank Negara \b \highlight22\uc2 Malaysia\b0 \highlight\uc2  checked in the market, it didn't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Traders said they were amazed at the ringgit's steep rise of more than 700 points in less than two weeks and the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's lack of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . 'Market players are taking this as a signal the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  favors a stronger \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 ,' a trader with a foreign bank said, adding 2.4500 ringgit looks possible Friday. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 13-04-95 \par \par \uc2  0941GMT \par \par \uc2  1026 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025dr4d02n1f\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
