\par\par \b \uc2  SE Asian Central Banks Won't Coordinate  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  Attacks \b0\par\par\uc2 177 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1995\par 12:22\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Co., Inc.) \par \par \uc2  KUALA LUMPUR (AP-DJ)--Southeast Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  officials, who met in January at the invitation of the Hong Kong \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  to discuss cooperative efforts in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets, will not undertake coordinated \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Bank Negara \b \highlight22\uc2 Malaysia\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor Ahmad Mohd Don said Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  Officials from central banks in Malaysia, Indonesia, Thailand, Philippines and the \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  of Singapore met January 21 in Hong Kong to discuss ways to cooperate against \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  speculators, after \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  players sank regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , starting with the Indonesian rupiah and the Thai baht. \par \par \uc2  Little information has emerged about the meeting, and it is only known that a hotline was established for exchange of information. Whether or not other efforts to beat speculators were established was hazy. \par \par \uc2  Speaking to reporters at the release of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's annual report, Mohd Don said that there is 'no question of joint \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ' in the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets, and that cooperation was 'more on sharing of information.' \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 29-03-95 \par \par \uc2  1022GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025dr3t027bs\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
