\par\par \b \uc2  Malaysian Ringgit Lower Vs Dlr; Interest Rates Up \b0\par\par\uc2 262 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 17 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1995\par 10:36\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Co., Inc.) \par \par \uc2  KUALA LUMPUR (AP-DJ)--The Malaysian ringgit was slightly lower against the U.S. dollar Friday on profit-taking activities, traders said. \par \par \uc2  However, news that Bank Negara \b \highlight22\uc2 Malaysia intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the interbank market to support one-month deposits at higher levels of between 5.65% and 5.70% compared with 5.50% Thursday helped the ringgit close off the day's lows against the dollar, they said. \par \par \uc2  At the close, the dollar was traded higher at 2.5500 ringgit compared with 2.5465 ringgit Thursday but lower from its opening level of 2.5520 ringgit. \par \par \uc2  Traders noted that the ringgit opened weaker against the dollar, but on news of higher \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  levels by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the interbank market around 0300 GMT the ringgit started to strengthen. \par \par \uc2  'We heard several banks from Singapore were buying the ringgit,' the trader with a foreign bank said. \par \par \uc2  He said sentiment on the ringgit was improving, partly buoyed by Moody's upgrade of Malaysia's foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  rating from A2 to A1 and also because of expectations of higher interest rates. \par \par \uc2  Traders said Bank Negara's action triggered an across-the-board rise in interbank rates. \par \par \uc2  The key three-month Kuala Lumpur Interbank Offered Rate (KLIBOR) was 10 basis points higher at 5.89% from 5.79% previously while the usually more volatile one-month KLIBOR rose to 5.71% from 5.63%. The 12-month rate also inched up to 6.64% from 6.61% Thursday. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 17-03-95 \par \par \uc2  0936GMT \par \par \uc2  1026 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025dr3h01yi3\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
